{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07343","headline":"入白沙渚夤缘二十五里至石窟山下怀天台陆山人 · 刘长卿","name":"入白沙渚夤缘二十五里至石窟山下怀天台陆山人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远屿霭将夕，玩幽行自迟。\n归人不计日，流水闲相随。\n辍棹古崖口，扪萝春景迟。\n偶因回舟次，宁与前山期。\n对此瑶草色，怀君琼树枝。\n浮云去寂寞，白鸟相因依。\n何事爱高隐，但令劳远思。\n穷年卧海峤，永望愁天涯。\n吾亦从此去，扁舟何所之？\n迢迢江上帆，千里东风吹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07343.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07343","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}